{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02762","headline":"咏史四首 三 · 卢照邻","name":"咏史四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公业负奇志，交结尽才雄。\n良田四百顷，所食常不充。\n一爲侍御史，慷慨说何公。\n何公何爲败，吾谋适不同。\n仲頴恣残忍，废兴良在躬。\n死人如乱麻，天子如转蓬。\n干戈及黄屋，荆棘生紫宫。\n郑生运其谋，将以清国戎。\n时来命不遂，脱身归山东。\n凛凛千载下，穆然怀春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}